---
// Iframe 嵌入视频组件
// 用于在文章中嵌入外部视频（如 Bilibili、YouTube 等）
import { normalizeIframeUrl } from '@/utils/iframe-url';

interface Props {
  src: string;
  title?: string;
}

const { src, title = '嵌入视频' } = Astro.props;
const processedSrc = normalizeIframeUrl(src);
---

{
  processedSrc && (
    <div class="my-6">
      <div class="video-wrapper !mb-0 !my-0">
        <iframe
          src={processedSrc}
          title={title}
          allow="accelerometer; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen"
          allowfullscreen
          loading="lazy"
          sandbox="allow-same-origin allow-scripts allow-popups allow-presentation"
        />
      </div>
      {(() => {
        if (!processedSrc || !processedSrc.includes('bilibili.com')) return null;

        const match = processedSrc.match(/video\/(BV\w+)/) || processedSrc.match(/bvid=(BV\w+)/);
        const bvid = match ? match[1] : null;

        if (bvid) {
          return (
            <a
              href={`https://www.bilibili.com/video/${bvid}`}
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="text-xs text-muted-foreground hover:text-primary transition-colors mt-0.5 block text-right lg:hidden"
            >
              📺 去 Bilibili 观看高清原视频 &gt;
            </a>
          );
        }
        return null;
      })()}
    </div>
  )
}

<style>
  .video-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    padding-bottom: 56.25%; /* 16:9 */
    height: 0;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--muted);
  }

  .video-wrapper iframe {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
  }
</style>
